  "notes": "Belden's technical data sheet for part number 943935001 reads 'Port Type and Quantity: 9 ports in total: 4 x Combo Ports (10/100/1000BASE TX, RJ45 plus FE/GE-SFP slot); 5 x standard 10/100/1000BASE TX, RJ45', V.24 interface '1 x RJ11 socket', USB for the ACA21-USB, 12/24/48 V DC (9.6-60 V) or 24 V AC, max 20 W, 0 to +60 C, DIN rail IP20, 530 g. Software Layer 2 Enhanced: VLAN (802.1Q), IGMP snooping/querier v1/v2/v3, RSTP 802.1D-2004, MRP (IEC 62439-2) and HIPER-Ring, CLI, web management, SNMP v1/v2/v3, LLDP, SNTP. The combo EDA position is why this is 13 interfaces for a 9-port box. Life cycle, from Belden's configurator page for the HHXX.X. build: availability 'passiv', last order 2023-12-31, last delivery 2024-06-30 - modelled as hardware already on a DIN rail rather than a current order. Family manual: https://www.doc.hirschmann.com/pdf/IG_RS20_RS30_RS40_Managed_08_0325_en_2025-03-27.pdf"
